## Scope boundary

This is a reference multi-token forward correctness harness. It is not generation, sampling, persistent production KV optimization, NEON/Vulkan/QNN, or Android integration.

A complete independent Python golden comparison for all 24 layers and four real tokens has not yet been claimed. Layer 0 has the existing detailed Python verification; the new multi-token path has structural causal tests, real-model sequence execution, position-0 regression, finite logits, and sanitizer coverage.
